OL,3,GNEWSATwo jailed for violent disorder at
OL,4,Aasylum hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed for more than
OL,7,Ftwo years after taking part in protests
OL,8,Foutside an asylum hotel in Essex last
OL,9,Fsummer.
OL,11,FAn "aggressive mob" of hundreds of
OL,12,Fpeople gathered outside the Bell Hotel
OL,13,Fin Epping, Essex, in July 2025, after
OL,14,Fone of the migrants living there was
OL,15,Fcharged with sexual assault, Chelmsford
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FJonathan Glover, 47, from Springfields,
OL,19,FWaltham Abbey, was sentenced to two
OL,20,Fyears and six months in prison for
OL,21,Fviolent disorder.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
